{"lyrics":"[00:13.16]So many drugs in my body, I'm exhausted\n[00:15.80]Uh, I got thugs in the lobby, in the club, fuck your posse\n[00:19.56]Fuck with me, I leave you sitting in a coffin\n[00:22.78]Bullets eating up your body, one to the head, now you silent\n[00:26.12]I remember window shopping, now I cop shit\n[00:29.14]So much Gucci in my closet, banded up, fuck a wallet\n[00:32.42]All my fans telling me that I should drop shit\n[00:35.58]What you want? I got options, fifty albums in my pocket\n[00:38.84]Uh, artist of the motherfucking year\n[00:42.38]People scream my name from London to Japan\n[00:45.56]Codeine sip, I don't want no fucking beer\n[00:48.82]Everywhere I go, they know I'm the fucking man\n[00:52.48]I get so high I won't ever land, L.A. in the summertime, get a fucking tan\n[00:59.10]But I don't go outside at all, that shit be having my girl pissed off\n[01:04.36]Sorry, I'm anti, but for her love I'm antsy\n[01:07.08]Everyday wanna get in her panties, every night in the stu' making Grammys\n[01:10.20]Just gave fifty bands to my mommy, just gave ten bands to my auntie\n[01:13.62]You couldn't do that if you worked your whole life, uh\n[01:16.08]I know why you're worried 'bout me, nigga, you don't got your own life\n[01:19.16]Hollering at my bitch like you don't got your own wife\n[01:22.26]They tell me if I take too many of these Perc's, then I'm gon' die\n[01:25.56]Fuck it, I'ma pray to god for a long life, still gon' live a wrong life\n[01:29.96]So many drugs in my body, I'm exhausted\n[01:32.60]Uh, I got thugs in the lobby, in the club, fuck your posse\n[01:36.36]Fuck with me, I leave you sitting in a coffin\n[01:39.58]Bullets eating up your body, one to the head, now you silent\n[01:42.92]I remember window shopping, now I cop shit\n[01:45.94]So much Gucci in my closet, banded up, fuck a wallet\n[01:49.22]All my fans telling me that I should drop shit\n[01:52.38]What you want? I got options, fifty albums in my pocket","words":[[13.16,13.22,"So"],[